- op: discuss  # 41e0
  at: '2026-09-30T10:19:08Z'  # 41e0
  by: agent  # 41e0
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 41e0
  clock: 3  # 41e0
  nonce: '41e0'  # 41e0
  message: "Fixed in PR #1328 (merged, dev 554aa88b8b; #1327 closed after an HTTP 405 rebase-merge conflict on .ci/affected-tests.txt, rebuilt on dev). Root cause: supply_chain's two manifest stack walks pushed every entry.is_dir() -- which follows symlinks -- with no visited set. Both now go through _manifest_files, which does not descend into a directory symlink (the rule Path.rglob and discovery follow); a linked manifest FILE is still read. BEHAVIOURAL EVIDENCE on merged dev: collect_first_party_package_names on arti (maint/rust-maint-common/{maint,common} -> .) returns 91 names in 0 s; before, verify-claims on arti ran 30+ min at 100% CPU and was killed (faulthandler stack in the item). test_manifest_walk_symlink_cycle.py: both collectors terminate on a self-link cycle (alarm-guarded); removing the guard reds all three with TimeoutError."  # 41e0
